5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's the first day, we have no information to go on. I suggest we keep our discussions logical and calm.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. Let's just be careful and... and try to get along. I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Misaki. A logical approach is the only way to ensure we don't make a premature mistake. Let's focus on identifying contradictions in our statements as the game progresses.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. Since we have no data yet, the most rational course of action is to observe and analyze the patterns of our speech. Let's see how everyone reacts as the information unfolds.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I agree that we should start calmly and get to know each other first. I'll do my best to support everyone and help the village!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Since we all agree on the approach, I'll spend this turn observing. Does anyone have a specific strategy for how we should handle the voting process once we reach Day 1?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not really sure... maybe we should just... trust the Seer if they come forward? I don't want to make a mistake and vote for someone innocent.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Trusting the Seer is a sound baseline, but we must be cautious. A werewolf could easily fake the role to mislead us. We should evaluate the Seer's claims against the behavior of the accused before voting.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Asuka makes a valid point. A fake Seer is a common tactic. We should analyze the timing of the claim and whether the accused's reaction is consistent with their established personality. Logic must override blind trust.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think both Daisuke and Asuka have good points. It's scary to make a mistake, but we have to be careful. Let's try to maintain a friendly atmosphere while we look for the truth together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Midori that a friendly atmosphere helps, but we shouldn't let it cloud our judgment. For now, I don't have any suspicions. I'll pass this turn.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't have any suspicions either. Everyone seems so nice... I'll just keep listening and try to understand what's happening.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip.""}]}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I also have no specific suspicions at this moment. Since we are all in agreement on the general strategy, I will also pass this turn and continue observing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no leads yet. I will also pass this turn and focus on analyzing the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I'll pass as well. It's a bit nerve-wracking, but I'm glad we're all being so considerate of one another. I'll just keep listening and observing for now.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,It seems we have reached a consensus for the first day. I will pass this turn as well. Let's see what information the Seer brings to the table tomorrow.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
